CM_ BO_ 1280 "VCU 0x500 - TPS0: throttle%, tps0%, raw value, calib min/max";
CM_ BO_ 1281 "VCU 0x501 - TPS1: throttle%, tps1%, raw value, calib min/max";
CM_ BO_ 1282 "VCU 0x502 - BPS0: brake%, raw voltage, calib min/max";
CM_ BO_ 1285 "VCU 0x505 - Dash Fault: u32 LE bitfield (bytes 0-3). Bits: 0x1 tpsOutOfRange, 0x2 bpsOutOfRange, 0x4 tpsPowerFailure, 0x8 bpsPowerFailure, 0x10 tpsSignalFailure, 0x20 bpsSignalFailure, 0x40 tpsNotCalibrated, 0x80 bpsNotCalibrated, 0x100 tpsOutOfSync, 0x200 bpsOutOfSync, 0x400 tpsbpsImplausible.";
CM_ BO_ 1287 "VCU 0x507 - LV battery voltage (0-1), regen torque (2-3), efficiency score (4-5), dash mode (6), energy remaining % (7).";
CM_ BO_ 1298 "VCU 0x512 - Power Limit Status B: PID integral, PL torque, target power, PID output, clamp method";
CM_ BO_ 1536 "Custom_BMS 0x600 - Safety Checker: fault/warning flags, cell imbalance, HV sense, and pack V (Sum + HVsens). Dashboard reads pack V from bytes 6-7.";
CM_ BO_ 1569 "Custom_BMS 0x621 - State of Charge: SOC capacity (s16 mAh), SOC percent (u16 × 0.01 %), pack current (s32 mA)";
CM_ BO_ 1570 "Custom_BMS 0x622 - Pack Summary 1: highest/lowest cell voltage (scale 0.0001 V), highest/lowest cell temp (s8 °C), total pack voltage. Dashboard reads lowest cell V from bytes 2-3 and highest cell temp from byte 4.";
CM_ BO_ 1571 "Custom_BMS 0x623 - Pack Summary 2: fault/warning flags in byte 0, pack imbalance (s16 mV), HV sense, pack SOC (s16 mAh)";
CM_ BO_ 165 "Motor RPM (bytes 1-2)";
CM_ BO_ 1009 "SHUNT 0x3F1 - pack current (s32 LE, mA). Dashboard scales to A.";
CM_ BO_ 1011 "SHUNT 0x3F3 - pack bus voltage (s32 LE, mV). Dashboard scales to V.";

